# NOTE: google-services.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It ships inside every
# APK (its API key is restricted to this app's package + signing cert), and EAS
# Build archives the project via git — ignoring it would silently produce a build
# with no FCM config, so push would fail at runtime with no build-time error.
GoogleService-Info.plist
